# Analytics conventions

**Canonical doc:** `lib/analytics/CLAUDE.md`

## Dual tracking

| Source | Config | Client editable? |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Salt GTM/GA4 | `NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID` in env | No |
| Client GA4 | Sanity Developer Settings → `clientGoogleAnalyticsId` | Yes |

Wired in `app/layout.tsx`: `GoogleTagManagerScript`, `ClientGoogleAnalyticsScript`, `ConsentProvider`, trackers.

## Usage

- Import helpers from `@/lib/analytics` (`trackCTAClick`, `trackFormSubmit`, etc.)
- **Never bypass consent** — all `track*` functions check consent
- Trackers (`PageViewTracker`, `ScrollTracker`, etc.) live once in root layout only

## Debug

`AnalyticsDebugOverlay` in dev; verify events in GTM Preview before launch.
